Dear Valued Customer, We hope this message finds you well. At SecureTech Solutions, we are committed to ensuring the security and integrity of your data. As part of our ongoing efforts to enhance your experience and safeguard your information, we are excited to announce several updates to our account security features. **1. Two-Factor Authentication (2FA):** Starting next week, we will be rolling out an optional Two-Factor Authentication feature for all user accounts. This added layer of security will require you to verify your identity using a secondary method, such as a text message or authentication app, whenever you log in from a new device. We highly recommend enabling this feature to help protect your account from unauthorized access. **2. Password Strength Meter:** To further bolster account security, we are introducing a password strength meter during the account creation and password change processes. This tool will guide you in creating stronger, more secure passwords by providing real-time feedback on their strength. **3. Security Alerts:** We have also enhanced our security alert system. You will now receive notifications for any suspicious activity on your account, including failed login attempts and changes to your account settings. These alerts will be sent directly to your registered email address and mobile device. **4. Educational Resources:** To help you stay informed about best practices for online security, we have created a dedicated resource center on our website.